      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sarith, City of Tides [zone=808]\n**Who:**\n- Renarra [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 73\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Zones:**\n- Rubak Oseka, Temple of the Sea [zone=809]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a coral ophidian [npc=38556]\n- a revered ophidian [npc=38555]\n- a ringed ophidian [npc=38554]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Nov 21 20:10:47 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **For an overview of the Veil of Alaris expansion, a task listing, and information about group/raid progression, spells, and armor, **click here**.**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with a Kedge named Renarra in Sarith, located at about -60, -800, -2 (northeast part of the dock area)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- 73 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Renarra'\nRenarra says '\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_! In the name of the Prexus, it's time to [take down] the Temple of Rubak Oseka!'\nYou say, 'Take down the temple?'\nRenarra says 'Before we launch our offense against the Temple, we need to weaken its inhabitants. Are you here to [help]?'\nYou say, 'I'll help!'\nRenarra says 'The Temple is filled with various inhabitants; mainly the Alarans and Hadal. There may also be ophidians as they are the beloved animals of Oseka, the God of Tides. Take your pick and remove them. Prexus will ensure you are greatly rewarded for your valiant efforts.'\n_A task window pops up with five tasks to choose from._\nYou have been assigned the task 'Diminishing the Temple - Ophidians'.\nBeing Oseka's beloved animals, Renarra believes that killing the sacred ophidians may reduce Oseka's power. Dive into the watery depths and take out the ophidians.\n\n---\n\nDefeat the coraled ophidians 0/4 (Rubak Oseka)\nDefeat the revered ophidians 0/4 (Rubak Oseka)\nDefeat the ringed ophidians 0/4 (Rubak Oseka)\n_The ophidians are snakes found mostly in the bottom floor of the temple, and in greater numbers in the water under the bottom floor._\nSpeak with Renarra 0/1 (Sarith)\nYou say, 'Hail, Renarra'\nYou've taken out the ophidians in the Temple of Rubak Oseka.\n_Reward:_\nExperience\n136 platinum",
