      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Shadeweaver's Tangle [zone=1309]\n**Who:**\n- Terro Kai [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Shak Dratha Token [item=145128]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Sentry Kedra Kai [npc=58349]\n- Zun Tetorau [npc=58664]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of Shadeweaver's Tangle (10 Points) [quest=12235]\n**Era:** | !Night of Shadows\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Dec 6 15:30:22 2022\nModified: Sat Jan 27 08:11:08 2024 | | **Night of Shadows Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nYou can obtain this task from Terro Kai [npc=58357] in Shadeweaver's Tangle. You can find Terro Kai at /waypoint 474, 91, -198. He/she is on the find tool as well CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Terro Kai'\nTerro Kai's ears perk up, a telltale sign that he is very pleased to see you again. '\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_! I am so glad to see you! You helped me with trying to find out what happened to my brother back in Ka Vethan. As you can see, I was able to make it out of there with my life intact, thanks to your help. Now I seem to find myself amidst another [underhanded plot] and could use your experience to get to the bottom of this once and for all.'\nYou say, 'underhanded plot'\nTerro Kai says, 'Indeed, I need you to believe me when I tell you that I have stumbled upon a stomach-turning scene within the caves here. One day, I heard a bunch of voices and chanting echoing through the cave system, so I decided to investigate. I was not prepared for what I [found].'\nYou say, 'What was it that you found?'\nTerro Kai's eyes grow wide as he stares at nothing. He is very distraught by what he found. 'Bodies, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, bodies everywhere. They were tied down onto burning beds of coal. The stench was unbearable. Each of the pits that had a body in it was surrounded by a dark energy that I only saw when I was in Ka Vethan. I think that the Akheva may be behind this sudden rush of Shak Dratha into the area. All of this feels all too familiar to me. I know it is a lot to ask, but could you please try to find this [scene] somewhere in these caves?'\nYou say, 'scene'\nTerro Kai says, 'I fear my mind is playing tricks on me. I fear that I didn't actually see what I saw. It was so visceral, so vile. Please, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, I am begging for your help. Have I [gone mad]? Survey these caves and tell me that I did not conjure up what I saw from a nightmare.'\nYou say, 'I will prove that you have not gone mad.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'It Takes Two to Tangle'.\nTerro Kai's shoulders slump as he lets out a sigh of relief. 'Thank you \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, I knew I could count on you for this. Come back to me once you find it, so I know I haven't lost my mind.'\n\n---\n\n1\\. Prove Terro is not insane 0/1 Shadeweaver's Tangle\nEnter the cave tunnels and go north the 3rd cave up has some graves that has a spot at /loc +2295, +54 to update this task, along with a yellow emote :\nAs you enter this part of the caves, the smell of burning flesh is overwhelming. This must be the scene that Terro was talking about. You wretch for a moment as you cover your mouth and nose to mask the smell.\n2\\. Return to Terro and tell him what you found 0/1 Shadeweaver's Tangle\nYou say, 'Hail, Terro Kai'\nTerro Kai has a worried look on his face before speaking. 'You found it! So I'm not mad! This is both terrible and good news. A real Luclin's Gambit, if you will.' He winces as he says that. 'I just made that up.' An awkward pause is felt between the two of you. It is almost painfully long. You try to speak, but he interrupts you. 'Anyway, this is clearly something we need to warn the local guards about. Visit Sentry Kedra Kai in the training area and tell him what you found.'\n3\\. Visit Sentry Kedra Kai 0/1 Shadeweaver's Tangle\nSentry Kedra Kai is located at +208, -1389, -169.06 at the first crossroads west of Shar Vahl.\nYou say, 'Hail, Sentry Kedra Kai'\nSentry Kedra Kai's demeanor is stern, stoic, and determined as you approach. He addresses you with an intensity that tells you that he is not in the mood for small talk. 'Another adventurer graces my presence yet again. Tell me, do you have anything [important to report], or are you here to give me more jawbones?'\nYou say, 'I have something important to report.'\nSentry Kedra Kai's tone changes as you inform him of what you and Terro have found. His face grows more concerned as you continue. 'I see, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, that actually is something important to report. The Shak Dratha have been pouring in from the north, but we are not sure what is driving them to do so. We have some suspicions as to what it could be.' He snorts the air and looks to the west. \"Akheva, probably. We need to clear out those caves first. \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, thank you for reporting this to me, I'll have to work with the other guards to clear out those caves. In the meantime, we would all benefit from less Shak Dratha around here. Get rid of them for us.'\n4\\. Cull the Shak Dratha 0/10 Shadeweaver's Tangle\nThese are the mobs in the tunnels.\n5\\. Loot the strange trinket 0/1 Shadeweaver's Tangle\nThe 10th and last kill will have 1-6 Shak Dratha Token [item=145128] on the body for everyone in the group with the task.\n6\\. Deliver the trinket to Terro 0/1 Shadeweaver's Tangle\nTerro Kai is relieved to see you leave the caves. 'You're still alive, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_! I was afraid that you were being burned alive and your soul torn asunder. I am very happy to be wrong.' His face grows concerned as he looks at the trinket you handed him. 'I know these markings. These are from Ka Vethan. The Akheva have been using the Shak Dratha as fodder for their campaign to take over Luclin. I need you to bring this to Sentry Kedra Kai immediately, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!'\nYou have been given: Shak Dratha Token\n7\\. Bring the trinket to Sentry Kedra Kai 0/1 Shadeweaver's Tangle\nSentry Kedra Kai takes the trinket and holds it in the palm of his hand silently for a few moments before speaking. 'Well, whatever suspicions we had about who was behind this have been quashed, not that it was too hard to figure out.' He tucks the token into his pocket. 'We have been hearing reports of voices being heard from within the caves to the south. We think this is where the Akheva have built a headquarters. I want you to find this place and if you see anybody who looks to be in charge, kill them so we can be done with this.'\n8\\. Locate the Akhevan headquarters 0/1 Shadeweaver's Tangle\nGo back in to the tunnel and go south, the task will update before the last room at /loc +60, +1227, -344.71.\nThe voices you have been hearing echo in the mines are getting louder as you approach. This is the place that Sentry Kedra told you to go. Locate who may be running things and end their reign of terror.\n9\\. Slay Zun Tetorau 0/1 Shadeweaver's Tangle\nmob is in the south tunnel last small room room has two adds.\n10\\. Catch up with Terro Kai 0/1 Shadeweaver's Tangle\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n265 platinum 6 gold 2 silver 5 copper\nYou gain experience!",
