      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Shadeweaver's Tangle [zone=1309]\n**Who:**\n- Ian Naelev [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 120\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Severed Hopper Head [item=145133]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a clawed hopper [npc=58260]\n- a firefall hopper [npc=58263]\n- a firefall saurek hopper [npc=58264]\n- a needle clawed hopper [npc=58289]\n- a saurek hopper [npc=58290]\n- a small firefall hopper [npc=58308]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Mercenary of Shadeweaver's Tangle (10 Points) [quest=12234]\n**Era:** | !Night of Shadows\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Dec 6 16:14:31 2022\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Night of Shadows Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nYou can obtain this task from Ian Naelev [npc=58342] in Shadeweaver's Tangle. You can find Ian Naelev at /waypoint 848, -212, -192. He/she is on the find tool as well CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Ian Naelev'\nIan Naelev says, 'Hail and watch your step. The [vermin] around these parts will take a bite out of any in their path.'\nYou say, 'Vermin? It doesn't sound like you care for the wildlife.'\nIan Naelev says, 'These beasts do nothing but attack anything that moves and destroy what we have [built].'\nYou say, 'You have built?'\nIan Naelev says, 'Well, yes. Don't we all work hard to make our [home] more hospitable?'\nYou say, 'You should find a different place to call home?'\nIan Naelev says, 'Ha. What we need is someone to kill some [hoppers], [shik`nar] and [beetles].'\nYou say, 'I will kill some hoppers.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'That's Not Going to Grow Back'.\nIan Naelev says, 'The beasts run around these hills with their sharp claws and pointy teeth. Return their heads to me and you will be compensated.'\n\n---\n\n1\\. Kill hoppers in the Shadeweaver's Tangle 0/7 Shadeweaver's Tangle\n_These are found on the south wall._\n2\\. Loot severed hopper heads 0/7 Shadeweaver's Tangle\n3\\. Deliver the severed hopper heads to Ian Naelev 0/7 Shadeweaver's Tangle\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n118 p 5s 6cp\nExperience",
