      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Labyrinth of Spite [zone=1386]\n**Who:**\n- Zeivan [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 105\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a malicious husk [npc=61017]\n- a malicious vessel [npc=60978]\n- a nameless husk [npc=61002]\n**Era:** | !Shattering of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 13 02:53:01 2025\nModified: Thu Nov 27 14:40:22 2025 | | You can obtain this task from Zeivan just outside the cast area's gates down from The Vortex zone line at /way 679, 27, -13. She is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Zeivan'\nZeivan says, 'Isn't this just a friendly group of sunshine and rainbows?' The rogue hisses a chuckle of amusement. 'To get to the bottom of business here, it's best to thin the herd, so to speak. A crude way to put it, but we can afford to be a little [crude] in this realm of envy and spite, don't you think? That's enough rhetorical questions. Do you want a [job]? You'll be paid for your service to Norrath, I assure you.'\nYou say, 'I need a job.'\nZeivan says, 'Take your pick: The [husks], the [spiders], the [elves and gnomes], or perhaps the [minions] beneath our feet.'\nYou say, 'I want to hunt the husks.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Empty Shadows'.\nZeivan says, 'These, uh, shadowy figures -- are they truly people anymore?' Mischief is alight in her eyes. 'Is it amusing to think about? Oh, I love asking these thought-provoking questions. Well, perhaps they've lost their sentience or sanity, and you're releasing them from their torture. If any good in your heart is holding you back, just think of the mercy you're giving them.'\n\n---\n\nWith Norrath's good intentions at heart, and a bit of sass, the rogue Zeivan has a few jobs to reduce the ranks of the locals. She's asked that you take\nout several of the husks around the Labyrinth of Spite.\nKill eight of the robed husks and vessels.\n1\\. Kill 8 Husks and Vessels 0/8 Labyrint of Spite\nMobs that count:\na malicious vessel\na malicious husk\na nameless husk\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n?\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
