      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Miragul's Nightmare [zone=755]\n**What:**\n- Mysterious Sword [item=93254]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Globe of Pure Light [item=93392]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Xilixizan [npc=36505]\n- a battered chest [npc=36531]\n- a forgotten guardian [npc=36521]\n- a pool of darkness [npc=36508]\n- a shadowed beast [npc=36857]\n- a sorrowful shade [npc=36509]\n- a stalking shadow [npc=36511]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Nov 15 23:48:01 2010\nModified: Wed Jan 29 08:15:28 2025 | | _This is one of five pre-requisite tasks leading up to the Miragul's Nightmare mission, \"Miragul's Vendetta\". There are no pre-requisites for requesting this task._\n_To get this solo task, pick up \"A Mysterious Sword\", a groundspawn at approximately -100, 300 in Miragul's Nightmare (in the first clearing west of the zone-in), and right-click it._\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Sword of Shadows'.\nYou have found a mysterious sword that seems to whisper thoughts into your mind. What is its purpose? Perhaps only time will tell.\n\n---\n\n1\\. The sword thirsts for shadow. Defeat sorrowful shades to sate its desires 0/3 (Miragul's Nightmare)\n2\\. The sword thirsts for shadow. Defeat stalking shadows to sate its desires 0/3 (Miragul's Nightmare)\n3\\. The sword thirsts for shadow. Defeat pools of darkness to sate its desires 0/3 (Miragul's Nightmare)\n4\\. The sword calls for its former master. Talk to Xilixizan in Miragul's Nightmare 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\n_Xilixizan is a mephit found at location 445, 685 (in the large clearing that is northwest of the sword's location)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Xilixizan'\nXilixizan says 'I was hoping this day would never come. You found the sword. Lest you wish to be overcome by shadow by its curse, you must listen to what I have to say. The sword must be destroyed. After the sword consumed me and made me shadow, I had nothing but time to find a way to permanently destroy the sword. Through my endless hours of research, I believe I have discovered the means to destroy the sword. The sword shuns light and the the only means to obtain such powerful items of light is from the forgotten guardians that guard the palace to the north. Gather these globes of pure light from the forgotten guardians and return to me. It is the only means to destroy the sword.'\n5\\. Collect a globe of pure light from the forgotten guardians 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\n_This is a common drop from \"a forgotten guardian\" in the castle of Miragul's Nightmare. NOTE: The step will only update if dropped by a forgotten guardian. The ancient guardians drop the globe as well, but won't update the step._\n6\\. Return to Xilixizan and speak with him 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Xilixizan'\nXilixizan says 'You collected the orbs? That is excellent news. The next step is to take the orbs of light along with the sword and place them in a chest. The chest is infused with a spell to destroy the sword. If all works as I hope it does, the sword will be destroyed and you will be safe from its curse. Look for the chest in the nearby ruins.'\n7\\. Place the globe of pure light into the battered chest 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\n8\\. Place the mysterious sword into the battered chest 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\n_A battered chest spawns at about 445, 440 (in the ruins east of Xilixizan's location)._\n9\\. The sword has been destroyed, but it has spawned a shadowed beast. Destroy it! 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\n_A shadowed beast spawns as soon as you get the above updates. It attacks, hits for a max ~6,500 and is stunnable. If you got to this point in the task, you should handle this mob with ease._\na shadowed beast has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\na shadowed beast's corpse is no longer a problem.\n10\\. Return to Xilixizan and inform him the sword has been destroyed 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Xilixizan'\nXilixizan says 'I saw the flash of light from here when the sword was destroyed. I am pleased that you will not end up a servant of shadow as I have become. Although it is too late for me, I am glad you were able to save yourself. Please take this as a token of my gratitude. I will rest a bit easier knowing the sword will no longer trouble anyone.'\n\n---\n\n_Rewards:_\n315 platinum\nExperience\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n30 Dream Motes\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
