      walkthrough = "**Level:** 5\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nRoesager Thusten is the Paladin Guildmaster in the building on the right when you enter the Temple of Life complex in North Qeynos (/loc -123.51, -127.12, 2.19).\nYou will need to be at least Amiable to Priests of Life for Niclaus to talk to you.\nYou say, 'Who is Niclaus?'\nHow do you know to say this?\nRoesager Thusten says 'Niclaus Ressinn? Have you seen him? He is one of our paladins who was sent out to investigate the undead sightings in Qeynos Hills. I have a message from Jahnda for him, but I must continue my own search here in Qeynos. Could you take this to Niclaus? Your help would be appreciated.'\nAt indifferent faction, Roseager says 'The Temple of Life smiles upon you, friend...  but such a delicate matter can only be entrusted to our most loyal members.'\nYou receive a Note to Niclaus.\nYou need 200 faction (high amiable) to get the note to Niclauss.\nNiclaus roams the Qeynos Hills.  Give him the note.\nNiclaus Ressinn says 'Oh, things are becoming dire here in Norrath. May Rodcet protect us! I have gathered most of the evidence I will need to present to Jahnda, but I could still use your assistance with one final piece. I need to recover a rib bone from of the undead beasts that wander these hills. Be sure the rib bone comes from one of the putrid skeletons. They are the spawn of Bertoxxulous.'\n(need confirmation that there are no faction hits for this step)\nYou receive 4 copper.\nYou gain experience!!\nFind and kill a putrid skeleton and loot a Putrid Rib Bone.  Give it to Niclaus.\nNiclaus Ressinn says 'Excellent! Rodcet smiles upon us this day! Here, please take this pouch of evidence to Jahnda in the Temple of Life. She will know what we must do. I will remain here to keep an eye out for the minions of Bertoxxlous. Also, accept this small reward as a token of my appreciation of your efforts to rid Norrath of the influence of the Plaguebringer.'\nYour faction standing with Priests of Life has been adjusted by 50.\nYour faction standing with Knights of Thunder has been adjusted by 15.\nYour faction standing with Guards of Qeynos has been adjusted by 25.\nYour faction standing with Bloodsabers has been adjusted by -12.\nYour faction standing with Antonius Bayle has been adjusted by 7.\nYou receive 1 gold.\nYou receive 2 silver.\nYou receive 6 copper.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive a Pouch of Evidence.  Give it to Priestess Jahnda in the Temple of Life in North Qeynos, found at -64.93, -677.59, -11.81.\nPriestess Jahnda says 'Excellent work! You are surely under the protection and guidance of the Prime Healer. This evidence will help us greatly to convince Antonious and the guild leaders of Qeynos that the Bloodsabers are here and seek to destroy all we have worked so long for.'\nYour faction standing with Priests of Life has been adjusted by 50.\nYour faction standing with Knights of Thunder has been adjusted by 15.\nYour faction standing with Guards of Qeynos has been adjusted by 25.\nYour faction standing with Bloodsabers has been adjusted by -12.\nYour faction standing with Antonius Bayle has been adjusted by 7.\nYou receive 5 gold.\nYou gain experience!!\nCommon rewards are a Potion of Disease Warding or Potion of Light Healing.  Rare rewards are a Skullcap of Rodcet Nife or a Shield of Nife.Submitted by: alla4eqRewards:\n- Potion of Disease Warding [item=2517]\n- Potion of Light Healing [item=2555]\n- Shield of Nife [item=113106]\n- Skullcap of Rodcet Nife [item=103981]\n[",
